   pending: "unresolved refs to planned files of other packages: spw/history/curriculum-plans.spw#workbench_history_curriculum_plans"
  }
 }
 checked: "the IAB version table re-read on 2026-10-02, including version 2.3 of September 2026"
 corrections: #[
  "the Peabody citation is paraphrased from its own words on innovations of form",
  "later IAB guideline versions are dated from the version table instead of left as verify",
  "fact check 2026-10-02: the r3 gate receipt said pass while refs to planned files of other packages failed; it now records partial and names them"
 ]
